  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice for Human Rights Defenders and Social Leaders in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to promote human rights defenders and social leader&#x2019;s labor in their territories. Generate legal and social conditions for protection, prevention, justice and reparation. The project&#xb4;s target group are human rights defenders, victims and their families, local and national authorities and the international community. The project will be developed in Bogot&#xe1;, C&#xf3;rdoba, Cauca, Antioquia, Norte de Santander, Nari&#xf1;o, Meta and Putumayo</narrative>
  </description>
